# Shared Rules And Skills

When creating or updating rules or skills, make them available to both Claude and Cursor.

- If adding a Cursor rule, mirror the requirement in `CLAUDE.md`.
- If adding Claude guidance, mirror the requirement in `.cursor/rules/`.
- If creating or updating a skill, ensure both Claude and Cursor can discover and use it.
